5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at history. What became of our last three internal rollouts?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the budget. Let us check the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I am curious about the network. Let us look into network coverage at customer plants.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the daily losses. Time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Staffing is key. I will investigate the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,Agreed. History is a teacher. We must not repeat mistakes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Yes. Knowing the cost structure is essential before we commit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Exactly! If the signal is bad, the app fails. Let's verify.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The data must be grounded in reality, not just promises.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If no one is assigned, the work simply does not happen.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also look at the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will also look at in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also examine misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will also review handling of vendor queries.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us proceed with these investigations. Wisdom comes from looking.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope this clarifies the financial picture for us all.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Can't wait to see what we find! Let's get to work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
